<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="detailed" name="Detailed Architecture"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="2100" pageHeight="2200"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="CLEARING REGISTRATION PLATFORM
Arquitetura detalhada — CSV + Kafka → Multi-clearing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=22;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1100" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="AMAZON S3

Armazena o arquivo CSV diário com ~20–30 milhões de operações.
É a entrada batch do sistema." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="220" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eb" value="EVENTBRIDGE

Barramento de eventos AWS.
Detecta ObjectCreated no S3 e dispara o processo de importação." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="120" width="220" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="batch" value="AWS BATCH

Executa containers .NET para processamento pesado.
Lê CSV em streaming, paraleliza em Array Jobs e grava no DynamoDB." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="120" width="260" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="kafka" value="KAFKA

Entrada online/futura.
Recebe eventos de aplicações e resgates produzidos por outros sistemas." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="220" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="consumer" value="KAFKA CONSUMER

Serviço .NET que consome eventos Kafka, valida e persiste operações de forma idempotente." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="330" width="220" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ops" value="DYNAMODB — OPERATIONS

Banco NoSQL serverless.
Mantém o estado atual da operação, clearing destino e informações da origem." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8eaf6;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="210" width="280" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stream" value="DYNAMODB STREAMS

CDC do DynamoDB.
Publica alterações feitas na tabela Operations sem polling." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ede7f6;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="420" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lambda" value="AWS LAMBDA
Stream Processor

Função serverless acionada pelo Stream.
Filtra alterações elegíveis e publica uma mensagem na Registration Queue." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="410" width="280" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqs" value="AMAZON SQS
Registration Queue

Fila durável que desacopla persistência e integração externa.
Todas as clearings usam a mesma fila." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="400" width="280" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="worker" value="REGISTRATION WORKER
.NET

Consome a SQS, carrega a operação, controla retry/status e escolhe o adapter da clearing." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="640" width="280" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="factory" value="ADAPTER FACTORY

Strategy/Factory.
Usa o campo clearing para selecionar IClearingAdapter correto." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="860" width="280" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3a" value="B3 ADAPTER

Traduz o modelo interno para contrato/protocolo da B3." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="1060" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="xa" value="CLEARING X ADAPTER

Implementação específica da Clearing X." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1530" y="1060" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ya" value="CLEARING Y ADAPTER

Implementação específica da Clearing Y." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1810" y="1060" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="B3 API

Endpoint externo para registro da operação." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="1220" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cx" value="CLEARING X API

Endpoint externo da Clearing X." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1530" y="1220" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cy" value="CLEARING Y API

Endpoint externo da Clearing Y." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1810" y="1220" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reg" value="DYNAMODB — REGISTRATION

Estado atual do registro por operação + clearing.
Guarda tentativa, protocolo externo, erro e timestamps." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8eaf6;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="650" width="300" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hist" value="DYNAMODB — STATUS HISTORY

Auditoria append-only.
Registra cada transição de status e permite reconstruir a vida da operação." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="860" width="300" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dlq" value="DLQ

